{
 "datasets": "ARC-Easy and ARC-Challenge (allenai/ai2_arc; train+validation+test), CommonsenseQA (tau/commonsense_qa; train+validation, goldless test excluded) and HellaSwag (Rowan/hellaswag; train+validation, goldless test excluded), read from the HuggingFace auto-converted parquet via the datasets-server parquet API. Every question is classified into ONE meta-option category (roman > aota > nota > letterref > plain; see meta_option.py) and its gold position is recorded (position_census.py). This is a construction property of each benchmark, not any model's behaviour. MMLU numbers are cited from audit 56, not recomputed here.",
